t view is one thing...\\rBut sneaking a peek at other people’s\\nPC Boxes fills me with a guilty glee.","msg_0601_T25R1202_00002":"Did you know?\\nAbout my PC Box, I mean.\\rIt’s full of Pokémon everyone longs\\nfor, like...\\r...No, it would be immodest for me to\\nsay. It would sound like bragging.\\rIf you really must know, you can always\\nfind out yourself.","msg_0601_T25R1202_00003":"I visit every day to check on other\\npeople’s Dress-Up Data.\\rFor me, it’s like the first step to\\nfashion!","msg_0601_T25R1202_00004":"Oh, dear me! Gracious!\\nThis is almost scandalous!","msg_0601_T25R1202_00005":"For combinations of Pokémon and\\nAccessories, you can get ideas from\\fothers by observing what they do.","msg_0601_T25R1202_00006":"The same kind of Accessory can create\\nentirely different impressions.\\rIt really depends on where and how\\nit’s used.","msg_0601_T25R1202_00007":"I won a Backdrop drawing for\\nAccessories in the Goldenrod Tunnel.","msg_0601_T25R1202_00008":"What I like to do...\\rI like sneaking glances at the people\\nchecking out Dress-Up Data.","msg_0601_T25R1202_00009":"Warps to the GTS and the Trainer\\nRankings on 1F.","msg_0601_T25R1202_00010":"Warps to the Battle Video Gallery on 3F.","msg_0601_T25R1202_00011":"Connect to Nintendo Wi-Fi\\nConnection for Dress-Up Data? {YESNO 0}","msg_0601_T25R1202_00012":"Here, you may post the Dress-Up Data\\nof your Pokémon.\\rThe Dress-Up Data can be set up and\\nsaved in the Goldenrod Tunnel.\\rThe Dress-Up Data posted by other\\nTrainers may also be viewed here.\\rThe data may be sorted by Pokémon\\nfor convenient viewing.\\r","msg_0601_T25R1202_00013":"Connect to Nintendo Wi-Fi\\nConnection for Box Data? {YESNO 0}","msg_0601_T25R1202_00014":"Here, you may post the Box Data\\ncontaining your Pokémon.\\rChoose a wallpaper, then place your\\nPokémon on it to compose your scene.\\rWhen you are done, post it for other\\nTrainers to see.\\rThe Box Data posted by other Trainers\\nmay also be viewed here.\\r","msg_0601_T25R1202_00015":"USE","msg_0601_T25R1202_00016":"INFO","msg_0601_T25R1202_00017":"CANCEL"},"initTriggers":[],"initScripts":{},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_T25R1202_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_T25R1202_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_T25R1202_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_T25R1202_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_T25R1202_004":4,"_EV_scr_seq_T25R1202_005":5,"_EV_scr_seq_T25R1202_006":6,"_EV_scr_seq_T25R1202_007":7,"_EV_scr_seq_T25R1202_008":8,"_EV_scr_seq_T25R1202_009":9,"_EV_scr_seq_T25R1202_010":10,"_EV_scr_seq_T25R1202_011":11,"_EV_scr_seq_T25R1202_012":12,"obj_T25R1202_gsgirl2":0,"obj_T25R1202_gsbabygirl1":1,"obj_T25R1202_middlewoman1_2":2,"obj_T25R1202_gswoman1":3,"obj_T25R1202_gsgirl1":4,"obj_T25R1202_gsoldwoman1":5,"obj_T25R1202_mount_2":6,"obj_T25R1202_gswoman2":7,"obj_T25R1202_mystery_2":8}}
